### ========================================================
### TESTES INTEGRADOS - BACKEND ERP SAÚDE (DESENVOLVIMENTO WEB III)
### ========================================================

### 1. Status da API (Rota pública)
GET http://localhost:40000/ HTTP/1.1

### 2. Login para obter o token JWT
# @name autenticacao
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "qwe",
    "password": "qwe"
}

### Extração dinâmica do token retornado
@token = {{autenticacao.response.body.$.token}}

### 3. Tentativa de acesso SEM token (deve retornar auth: false)
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPacientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO 1: PACIENTES (CRUD COMPLETO)
### ========================================================

### 4. InsertPaciente - Inserir novo paciente
# @name criaPaciente
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPaciente HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nome": "Guilherme Siqueira",
    "cpf": "555.666.777-88",
    "telefone": "(17) 99888-7766",
    "data_nascimento": "1995-09-18",
    "removido": false
}

### 5. GetAllPacientes - Listar pacientes não removidos
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPacientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. GetPacienteByID - Buscar paciente por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPacienteByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. UpdatePaciente - Atualizar dados do paciente por ID
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePaciente/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nome": "Carlos Eduardo Silva Atualizado",
    "cpf": "111.222.333-44",
    "telefone": "(17) 99111-9988",
    "data_nascimento": "1985-04-12",
    "removido": false
}

### 8. GetPacientesToConsultas - Seleção de pacientes para consulta
GET http://localhost:40000/getPacientesToConsultas HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. DeletePaciente - Soft Delete do paciente
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePaciente/3 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO 2: CONSULTAS (CRUD COMPLETO)
### ========================================================

### 10. InsertConsulta - Inserir nova consulta relacionada a um paciente
# @name criaConsulta
POST http://localhost:40000/insertConsulta HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "paciente_id": 1,
    "medico_nome": "Dr. Roberto Martins",
    "data_consulta": "2026-05-10",
    "valor_consulta": 350.00,
    "diagnostico": "Exame ortopedico completo, solicitada ressonancia",
    "removido": false
}

### 11. GetAllConsultas - Listar consultas ativas (com nome do paciente via JOIN/Subquery)
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllConsultas HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. GetConsultaByID - Buscar consulta por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getConsultaByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. UpdateConsulta - Atualizar consulta por ID
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateConsulta/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "paciente_id": 1,
    "medico_nome": "Dra. Beatriz Costa",
    "data_consulta": "2026-03-10",
    "valor_consulta": 290.00,
    "diagnostico": "Consulta cardiologica de rotina com prescricao de exames",
    "removido": false
}

### 14. DeleteConsulta - Soft Delete da consulta
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteConsulta/2 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Logout
POST http://localhost:40000/Logout HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

